{{#with booking}}
<p class="greeting">Dear <strong>{{#if full_name}}{{full_name}}{{else}}{{#if customer_name}}{{customer_name}}{{else}}Traveller{{/if}}{{/if}}</strong>,</p>

<p class="lead">
  A warm note from your safari team in Arusha — we are following up on your recent quote request with
  <strong>Tanzania Safari Magic</strong>. We want to make sure you have everything you need to decide with confidence.
</p>

<p class="section-label">Your enquiry</p>
<div class="data-card">
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Safari / package</span>
    <span class="value">{{#if package_name}}{{package_name}}{{else}}Custom safari plan{{/if}}</span>
  </div>
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Travel date</span>
    <span class="value">{{#if start_date}}{{formatDate start_date}}{{else}}{{#if travel_date}}{{travel_date}}{{else}}Flexible / to confirm{{/if}}{{/if}}</span>
  </div>
  {{#if days_until}}
  <div class="row">
    <span class="label">Follow-up stage</span>
    <span class="value">{{days_until}}h courtesy check-in</span>
  </div>
  {{/if}}
</div>

<div class="info-box">
  <strong>How we can help right now</strong><br>
  • Refine lodge level, private vs group options, or add Kilimanjaro / Zanzibar<br>
  • Suggest better wildlife timing for your month of travel<br>
  • Answer questions on park fees, what is included, and how deposits work<br><br>
  There is still <strong>no online card charge</strong> — we only share deposit instructions after you accept a written quote.
</div>

<p>If you are still planning, reply with your preferred dates and group size. If your plans changed, a short reply is perfect — we appreciate the update either way.</p>

<div class="cta-row">
  <a class="btn" href="https://wa.me/255695108009">WhatsApp our Arusha team</a>
  <a class="btn-secondary" href="{{#if site_url}}{{site_url}}{{else}}https://tanzaniasafarimagic.com{{/if}}/booking">Update your request</a>
</div>

<p class="closing">We are here whenever you are ready — pole pole, at your pace.</p>
{{/with}}
